<urn:usf:cli-field-specification:rule-native-ordered-sequence:1> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Preserve observed bounded sequence order; refuse an unordered source." <urn:usf:graph:cli-schema-primitives> .
<urn:usf:cli-field-specification:rule-native-ordered-sequence:1> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:CliFieldDerivationRule> <urn:usf:graph:cli-schema-primitives> .
