<urn:usf:cli-field-specification:rule-native-trace-sequence:1> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Preserve the exact ordered native trace sequence. The producer must refuse unless the selected native reader supplies the complete sequence under its authenticated context; graph-value readers may not synthesize, lexically sort or infer this ordering." <urn:usf:graph:cli-schema-primitives> .
<urn:usf:cli-field-specification:rule-native-trace-sequence:1> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:CliFieldDerivationRule> <urn:usf:graph:cli-schema-primitives> .
