<urn:usf:cli-field-specification:rule-predicate-values:1> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Read only the exact source subject and predicate, verify object kind, unique semantic values, declared cardinality, lexical bounds and dependencies. Missing/conflicting data returns a field gap with source identities. Do not follow undeclared property aliases or reinterpret prose." <urn:usf:graph:cli-schema-primitives> .
